## Wildcard

A wildcard record is required because the deployment uses a wildcard
certificate (typical for RDP/SMB scope or multi-app deployments).

| Type | Name | Value | TTL |
|------|------|-------|-----|
{% for ip in base_ips %}
| A    | `*.{{ public_hostname_domain }}` | `{{ ip }}` | 300 |
{% else %}
| A    | `*.{{ public_hostname_domain }}` | `<set to DNG host public IP>` | 300 |
{% endfor %}

